{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Policy correction from operator: there is no global one-Verified-run-at-a-time rule. Independent, file-disjoint Gerrit changes may run LLM Review and CI concurrently. Continue parallelizing only where ticket readiness, file-impact separation, and exact-commit independent documentation review permit it."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788892438581411001,"uuid":"7909a320-fd83-4a15-9813-27da7508e7de"}